<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Jesus, Lord Jesus!</l><l>Why would Christians feel ashamed</l><l>And not call Your precious name?</l><l>That is the devil’s scheme.</l><l>Jesus, Lord Jesus!</l><l>All my friends they tell me</l><l>I have changed completely.</l><l>You satisfy me thoroughly.</l></lg>
<lg label="5."><l>Jesus, Lord Jesus!</l><l>How I love to touch You!</l><l>It’s by calling on You!</l><l>No other One will do!</l><l>Jesus, Lord Jesus!</l><l>As I call, I’m drinking,</l><l>Triune God partaking.</l><l>Lord, You’re my cup of salvation!</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
